API-18: openswmm exits with the error code when a simulation step fails

The 6.0.0 command line program returned the error code when open, initialize
or start failed, but when swmm_engine_step failed it printed "Error at step
...", wrote the report and returned 0. Return the step's error code instead
(it is SWMM_OK after a run that completes).

Apply from the root of a Stormwater-Management-Model checkout at cb3e192b:
    git apply API-18_swmm600.patch

diff --git a/src/cli/main.cpp b/src/cli/main.cpp
index 3db08b5..9f9451c 100644
--- a/src/cli/main.cpp
+++ b/src/cli/main.cpp
@@ -138,5 +138,5 @@ int main(int argc, char* argv[]) {
     double run_time = std::difftime(std::time(nullptr), start);
     std::printf("... OpenSWMM Engine completed in %.2f seconds.\n\n", run_time);
 
-    return 0;
+    return err;  // non-zero when a step failed
 }
